# Local dogfood run reports (gitignored); keep README and the tracked ledger.
# INDEX.md is the L4.dogfood-missing gate's evidence source (0700 R4 / ADR-090): the gate
# must decide a feature's fate from repository state, not from whatever run reports happen
# to sit in one machine's working tree.
/docs/dogfood/*
/docs/session-forensics-report-generation.md
/docs/design/prototypes/
/docs/report/*-history-anatomy.md
/docs/memo.md
!/docs/dogfood/README.md
!/docs/dogfood/INDEX.md

.scratch/
/.pi-subagents/

# pipeline-eval fixture scratch (task 0595): must stay git-visible during runs —
# the implement no-op guard probes git, and the global gitignore ignores scratch/
!tests/fixtures/pipeline-eval/scratch/
